Hello,

I've made some modifications to RHIPE (related to the DistributedCache)
with which one can now use RHIPE on a cluster when R is not present on
the cluster.

https://github.com/saptarshiguha/RHIPE/wiki/Using-rhipe-on-a-cluster--without--installing-R-on-the-nodes

This version of RHIPE is not yet released (0.65.5 minor 2) but will be
very soon. You can also read gzip files
from the HDFS.

I'll make an announcement when that happens.

* Hadoop 0.21

The API changes, I have a prototype with the new API changes, but i
heard 0.21 is not too stable.

So no updates on that field till 0.22.

However, some changes i will be implementing is avoiding the silly
rhipe_map_buff_size and hope to
have that in 0.66 (which will be 0.21)

Cheers
J

